values ('d6e7f8a9-0b1c-4d81-8e11-2f3a4b5c6d11', 'spanish-conversation-and-composition', 'Spanish Conversation and Composition', 'This course develops advanced-intermediate to advanced Spanish communication through sustained conversation, process-based composition, pronunciation refinement, public speaking, debate, and culturally grounded inquiry. Students practice Spanish as a tool for interpersonal exchange, academic writing, public presentation, and informed discussion of the Spanish-speaking world. The course emphasizes fluency, accuracy, register, revision, and rhetorical control. Students produce a portfolio of revised writing and recorded speaking that demonstrates growth across narrative, expository, argumentative, and source-based genres.');

