priate to the assignment."}, {"id": "9e8b12df-32ce-4a1b-9f84-52c6c5d47610", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Evidence and reasoning", "children": [{"id": "ede2b8b0-744e-4760-a4d7-3d25dd5e5908", "type": "concept", "title": "Examples"}, {"id": "d83d69d5-7a97-4f9b-a99c-2eb9171a1921", "type": "concept", "title": "Data and sources"}, {"id": "214c2af9-3077-4a9b-b552-e6fe40078a46", "type": "concept", "title": "Quotation integration"}, {"id": "bef0cdfe-25bc-4bff-bba3-07b894b0bf35", "type": "concept", "title": "Warrants and explanation"}], "description": "This subtopic moves students beyond opinion into supported argument."}, {"id": "3a4c7a42-178b-494d-86c0-8ab91219c51c", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Counterargument", "children": [{"id": "99328355-9c18-4ec9-98dd-4906942296ec", "type": "concept", "title": "Concession"}, {"id": "a1844c64-c9fc-4396-81a8-7fef1dbb4cab", "type": "concept", "title": "Refutation"}, {"id": "4bbb5d11-c7cf-4266-b84f-d81f61631e35", "type": "concept", "title": "Nuance"}, {"id": "9fd181e3-f50b-4102-8f0f-b86b951cd9e0", "type": "concept", "title": "Balanced tone"}], "description": "Students learn to engage opposing views respectfully and persuasively."}]}, {"id": "038386d8-ef03-4255-820f-589fa4c2f050", "type": "topic", "title": "Peer Review and Revision", "description": "Revision is treated as a core language-learning practice: students improve content, organization, accuracy, style, and reader awareness through feedback.", "children": [{"id": "6fa08b8a-0b07-460f-80f4-69aa77b17428", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Giving useful feedback", "children": [{"id": "a3980791-7434-49ba-87e0-c18691095e6c", "type": "concept", "title": "Global comments"}, {"id": "d91e975a-3560-4a2e-9ad8-6dd8de03e1fb", "type": "concept", "title": "Question-based feedback"}, {"id": "9db8bfa2-495b-4a77-8857-5c976140bdc1", "type": "concept", "title": "Evidence of strengths"}, {"id": "efb1f159-ba50-49a0-871a-9678946d3fa2", "type": "concept", "title": "Prioritized revision advice"}], "descripti